  <h2 id="sales">Who pays for these skills, and how they judge you</h2>

  <p>
    Institutions select on test scores, marks and fit. They judge you by subject depth, clarity and consistency.
  </p>
  <p>
    The first basic skill is turning a syllabus into a weekly plan you follow.
  </p>

  <h2 id="ai">AI and MSc entrance routes after BSc: which tasks are under pressure</h2>

  <p>
    AI tools explain topics and generate practice questions. Routine drill creation shrinks.
  </p>
  <p>
    Understanding, careful reasoning and persistence hold value. A staged path helps: now, use AI to explain and quiz; later, own research questions.
  </p>

